msgctxt "OPTION_VAL_IMMEDIATE"
msgid "Immediate"
msgstr "Omedelbart"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6203305
msgctxt "OPTION_VAL_DEFERRED"
msgid "Deferred"
msgstr "Uppskjutet"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6203307
msgctxt "RPCS3_DEFAULT_RESOLUTION_LABEL"
msgid "Default Resolution"
msgstr "Standardupplösning"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6203309
msgctxt "RPCS3_DEFAULT_RESOLUTION_INFO_0"
msgid ""
"The output resolution the emulated PS3 offers the game, as in RPCS3. Most "
"games run at 720p; some look better at 1080p, and some need 480p or 576p to "
"avoid bugs. Takes effect when content is loaded."
msgstr ""
"Den utdataupplösning som den emulerade PS3:an erbjuder spelet, precis som i "
"RPCS3. De flesta spel körs i 720p; en del ser bättre ut i 1080p och några "
"behöver 480p eller 576p för att undvika fel. Träder i kraft när innehåll "
"läses in."

