msgstr "Kantutjämning med flera samplingar"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6203369
msgctxt "RPCS3_MSAA_INFO_0"
msgid "Multi-sample anti-aliasing where the game asks for it, as in RPCS3."
msgstr ""
"Kantutjämning med flera samplingar när spelet begär det, precis som i RPCS3."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6203371
msgctxt "RPCS3_SHADER_QUALITY_LABEL"
msgid "Shader Quality"
msgstr "Skuggkvalitet"

#. Crowdin string ID: 6203373
msgctxt "RPCS3_SHADER_QUALITY_INFO_0"
msgid ""
"Precision of the shaders RPCS3 generates. Low is fastest, Ultra most "
"accurate."
msgstr ""
"Precisionen hos skuggprogrammen som RPCS3 genererar. Låg är snabbast, Ultra "
"är mest exakt."

#. Crowdin string ID: 6203375
